  cookingInstructions:
  - Chop the beef tripe into sliced
  - Chop the eggplant into sliced
  - Chop the string beans into sliced
  - Chop the banana heart into sliced
  - Chop the pechay into sliced
  - Chop the garlic into sliced
  - Chop the onion into sliced
  - Turn the stove to high heat
  - Put the pan in the stove
  - Add water
  - 'Add 1 tsp of salt '
  - Add the oxtail
  - Add the beef tripe
  - Put the pan lid and boil
  - Set aside the beef tripe
  - Set aside the oxtail
  - Add 1/2 Tbsp of cooking oil
