  - Add 1 tbsp of peanut butter
  - Add water
  - 'Stir the pan '
  - Add the tender oxtail
  - Add the beef trip
  - Add banana heart
  - Add string beans
  - Add pechay
  - Add eggplant
  - put the pan lid to simmer
